<title>USA: Met-Coil Systems Corp FY96 net falls.</title>
<headline>Met-Coil Systems Corp FY96 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.26		    $1.61</p>
<p> Net			    556		    4,500</p>
<p> Revs			41,600		   43,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: FY96 revenue is after sale of two significant product lines at Rowe Machinery, resulting in a $2.1 million gain. FY95 results restated to increase cost of goods sold because of error in calculating year-end LIFO reserve.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
